5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should start by identifying which past projects actually served their purpose. I'll look into the post-occupancy reviews and booking data.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with the need for usage data. I want to see the timetable records for rooms out of service and the booking data as well.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I am concerned about the people maintaining these facilities. I'll examine the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the technicians' manual routines.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to understand why our timelines keep slipping. I will check the survey findings in the older blocks and the delivery schedules by project rationale.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A fascinating start. I shall investigate the tender records over three budget cycles and the renewal reserve for equipment to see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
